+// Sharing a tab must not tell its page that somebody looks at it (security
+// review of tab/102): the capture paints the page and changes nothing its
+// scripts can read. document.hidden stays true and no visibilitychange fires
+// when a share of a tab in the background starts or ends.
+bool ReArcTabDelegate::KeepsPageHiddenWhileCaptured(content::WebContents*) {
+  return true;
+}
